# Bandit Level 9 → Level 10 

## Goal
The goal was to find the password for the next level is stored in the file data.txt, which contains base64 encoded data

## Commands used
- base64 -d data.txt
- man base64

## Explanation
' base64 -d data.txt ' handles Base64 encoding within data.txt
' -d ' decodes the content within data.txt
' man base64 ' manual to help me with what command I would need to use.

## Result
I was able to retrieve the password for the next level.

## What I learned
I learnt the 'base64' commands and using the 'man base64' allowed me to understand how to decode the password I am searching for.
